{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>A number is multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is added to that product, resulting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/489263c8336e32dbda8c2160060f5aacb822c9e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$134$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />. What is the original number?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the original number. We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95b3011b1b42a4e3466d06a68ffd4feed4962e54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Nx + 14 = 134$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22da8ae18caa5e6d03d39b5bd4b392dc0b90c621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Nx = 134 - 14 = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"172\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b6ec42a0c93d39ab428d4709fd84e1472a24a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{120}{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 2\">player 2</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262db6b3c1078b129927c28b4268ac6237cad6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/8/9f80a7791eba7549733c11dfa072bbb8fc195788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{120}{10} = \\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<t